# Imports, Manifests, Compose, Projects) that must never be swept into git.
# Ignore everything, then explicitly un-ignore only the root docs and the
# Atmavictu product source meant to be tracked here (including web/, the
# Faza 2 frontend). Do not switch this to a denylist pattern.
*

!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!README.md
!.clinerules/
!.clinerules/**
!memory-bank/
!memory-bank/**
!requirements-dev.txt
!pyproject.toml
!.github/
!.github/**
!PR_BODY.md
!Projects/WorkShade/CHANGELOG_ingest_delo_proposals.md

# Atmavictu / Book Workbench product source
!docs/
!docs/**
!schema/
!schema/**
!src/
!src/**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!web/
!web/**

# Lucius — lokalni offline agent (Ollama); spomin je oseben in v git ne gre
!lucius/
!lucius/**
lucius/spomin.jsonl
lucius/zaoblak.jsonl
